SNOBOL4 pattern tutorial
 
1) literal match
   subject:   I MISS MY MOTHER
   matched MOTHER
 
2) SPAN(digits) capture
   subject:   price 4250 dollars
   number:    4250
 
3) BREAK to delimiter
   subject:   NAME=ALICE
   key:       NAME
 
4) literal + REM capture
   subject:   I FEEL HAPPY
   tail:      HAPPY
 
5) LEN with literal and variable
   subject:   HELLO WORLD
   first 5:   HELLO
   char[6]:   W
 
6) split key=value
   subject:   COLOR=BLUE
   key:       COLOR
   value:     BLUE
